      "text": "Many of these fools are addicted to adrenaline and endorphins.  The more they get the more they need, like any drug.  That is main reason for them being in these places.  Thrill seekers. Thrill seeking is increasing and becoming a burden to many governments and their rescue services.  Many insurance companies will now refuse to cover this kind of activity so the cost for the services are skyrocketing and have to be born by the idiots who get trapped and injured or die.  I really have no sympathy for this foolish behavior.  Borderline insanity, sheeesh! \nGreat video though.  Made me queasy and gave me the willies.",
